# Test: Y on the Cards equip page opens the bestiary on the highlighted card; Down moves to the next card; B goes
# back to the Cards equip page, and B again to the categories. Jian gets the Quetzalcoatl, Sasquatch, and Dark
# Jian cards (through the bag) and is level index 22 (LV 23).
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u8 0x0213BA29 1
poke u8 0x0213BA38 1
poke u32 0x020B4664 22
watch u32 0x020AFF84 menu
watch u8 0x02139FD7 page_kind
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot bo_00_equip
press Y 6
wait 60
shot bo_01_bestiary
press Down 6
wait 30
shot bo_02_next
press B 6
wait 60
shot bo_03_back
press Y 6
wait 60
shot bo_04_again
press B 6
wait 60
press B 6
wait 60
shot bo_05_categories
